@Marquee_HostAddress = http://localhost:5055

### Create a new Media item
POST http://localhost:5055/api/media
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
  "title": "Pulp Fiction",
  "originalTitle": "Pulp Fiction",
  "overview": "A burger-loving hitman, his philosophical partner, a drug-addled gangster's moll and a washed-up boxer converge in four tales of violence and redemption.",
  "posterUrl": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5iIlFn5s0ImszYzBPb8JPIfbXD.jpg",
  "backdropUrl": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/su89E5A7492A0k0S2y3s13Jk.jpg",
  "status": 3,
  "releaseDate": "1994-09-10T00:00:00Z",
  "tmdbId": 680,
  "imdbId": 110912,
  "mediaType": 1
}

### Update an existing Media item
PUT http://localhost:5055/api/media/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
  "title": "The Dark Knight",
  "originalTitle": "The Dark Knight",
  "overview": "Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets.",
  "posterUrl": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg",
  "backdropUrl": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QeXdLNwrD5SufAWhszm4VzpwV6.jpg",
  "releaseDate": "2008-07-18T00:00:00Z"
}
### Delete an existing Media item
DELETE http://localhost:5055/api/media/1

### Get all Media items to verify it saved
GET http://localhost:5055/api/media/1/details
